Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4955970,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-4955970","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:17Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4955970,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-4955970","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:17Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4955970,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4955970-1846018067944260","game_id":"steam-4955970","kind":"announcement","title":"Epoch Vault launches November 13!","summary":"Epoch Vault Launches November 13! The release date is officially set — and Steam Next Fest is just around the corner! Epoch Vault will officially launch on Steam on November 13, 2026! Steam Next Fest | October 19–26 Before release, Epoch Vault will take part in Steam Next Fest from October 19–26! Explore the Mesozoic era, discover prehistoric life, expand your scientific archive, and progress through millions of years of Earth's history in a relaxing idle/incremental game. Play the Demo Now! The","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T14:38:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067944260","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4955970-1845383656396263","game_id":"steam-4955970","kind":"update","title":"More Prehistoric Discoveries — A Major Epoch Vault Update","summary":"Discover more of the prehistoric world From life’s recovery after a mass extinction to the rise of dinosaurs, Epoch Vault now has even more to discover. The full game will feature 79 stages in the Triassic Period, 91 in the Jurassic Period, and 104 in the Cretaceous Period. We’ve refreshed the Codex illustrations, completely rewritten the Cretaceous entries, and improved translations across all 11 supported languages. Each discovery helps piece together the story of prehistoric life. A smoother ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T12:24:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396263","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4955970-1844115010502579","game_id":"steam-4955970","kind":"update","title":"A Major Triassic and Jurassic Update","summary":"The Triassic and Jurassic archives have been refreshed We’ve made a substantial update to two chapters of Epoch Vault. The texts for both the Triassic and Jurassic periods have been thoroughly proofread, and translations across all supported languages have been revised and improved. More to discover in the Jurassic The Jurassic archive has been expanded with new facts, giving you more to uncover as you explore its creatures and changing world. A clearer, more atmospheric look We’ve redrawn a sel","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T21:32:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010502579","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4955970-1842846814444780","game_id":"steam-4955970","kind":"update","title":"New Update: Triassic Archive Improved and Expanded","summary":"Every Triassic Codex entry, all 73 of them across all four phases, has been improved and expanded with new information from recent paleontology research, including studies from 2025 and 2026. Also in this update: several era backgrounds replaced with final release art minor camera bug fixes","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T22:39:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814444780","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4955970-1842212951300858","game_id":"steam-4955970","kind":"announcement","title":"Meet Frida — The Archive Keeper","summary":"Epoch Vault’s onboarding has been completely redesigned.Meet FR–1D.A / 07, codename Frida — the Archive Keeper assigned to guide researchers through the restoration process. Frida introduces the Archive’s core systems, warns you about incoming opportunities, and accompanies you as you restore each volume of the Mesozoic record.This update includes:• A fully redesigned onboarding experience• Frida, a new story character and guide• New dialogue and transitions between periods• Fixes for several mu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T17:24:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951300858","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4955970-1841579228675504","game_id":"steam-4955970","kind":"announcement","title":"Sharks Join the Archive","summary":"A new Epoch Vault update is here.This update improves performance, adds new nodes — including prehistoric sharks — and gives the Jurassic and Cretaceous trees a visual polish for cleaner, more readable branches.Thank you for playing and sharing your feedback.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-24T13:05:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228675504","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4955970-1840944183785483","game_id":"steam-4955970","kind":"announcement","title":"Epoch Vault Expands into the Cretaceous","summary":"The archive reaches the Cretaceous Development on Epoch Vault has reached its next major milestone. Volume III, devoted to the Cretaceous Period, is now part of the game and will be included in the launch version. After restoring the Jurassic, players will open a new progression tree that follows life from the rise of flowering plants and the last great sauropods through the reign of tyrannosaurs and horned dinosaurs, all the way to the asteroid impact that ended the age of dinosaurs. The new Vo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T09:13:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183785483","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4955970-1840310314348450","game_id":"steam-4955970","kind":"announcement","title":"Epoch Vault Expands into the Jurassic","summary":"The archive reaches the Jurassic Development on Epoch Vault has reached a major milestone. Volume II, devoted to the Jurassic Period, is now part of the game and will be included in the launch version. After restoring the Triassic, players will open a new progression tree that follows life from the recovering landscapes of the Early Jurassic to the giant sauropods, formidable predators, and early birds of the Late Jurassic. The new Volume is divided into Early, Middle, and Late Jurassic phases, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-09T00:42:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314348450","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4955970-1839041357038101","game_id":"steam-4955970","kind":"update","title":"Quick patch: faster first Tome","summary":"A quick follow-up to the last update, based on your feedback:The first Tome (your first \"publish\") now comes much sooner — less early grind before you unlock the prestige loop, while the mid and late game stay exactly the same.Thanks for playing, and keep the feedback coming. Steam Next Fest is in October — a wishlist really helps a solo dev! 🦕","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-28T12:08:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357038101","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4955970-1839041357034648","game_id":"steam-4955970","kind":"update","title":"Demo update: clearer seals, snappier clicks, cleaner UI","summary":"Thank you for the feedback!I went through the first reviews and player feedback and shipped a batch of fixes that make the demo feel better from minute one. Here's what changed.⛏️ Clicks feel meaningful nowThe \"Field Collection\" seal now grants a flat +1 tap power per level — clear and predictable, no fuzzy percentages.🦴 Seals are simplerRemoved the confusing \"branch specialization.\" You now have three clear upgrades — you always know what you'r